# Raw downloads. Stages 1 and 2 reproduce this directory exactly, and the ten
# filings alone come to about 95 MB of inline XBRL. What the project reads out
# of those filings is preserved under references/sec_filings/.
data/raw/

# Market data, and anything that carries it. The Treasury and ECB curves could
# be redistributed, but Yahoo Finance's terms do not allow it, and the aligned
# panel mixes all three. Both files are rebuilt by scripts/02_build_factors.py.
data/interim/
data/processed/factor_moves.csv

# Everything else in data/processed is model output or figures parsed from
# public SEC filings, and is committed so results can be read without a run.

